category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libGL-devel libQt5Core-devel libQt5Quick-devel libuchardet-devel
sdesc: "Cross-platform IRC framework written with Qt (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "Communi is a cross-platform IRC framework written with Qt. Communi provides a
set of tools for enabling IRC connectivity in Qt-based C++ and QML
applications."
